    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just lost everything. the business, the house, even my reputation. it happened so fast. i feel like i’m just falling and there’s no floor in sight. i can’t even face my family or my friends. the thought of them seeing me like this, just a total failure... it’s worse than the money. i just want the descent to stop.",
