      "content": "It is incredibly heavy to carry this shame, but please know that the person looking back at you is still there, even if they are buried under the weight of what happened. The fact that you are still reaching out, even in this darkness, proves that a part of you is fighting to survive, not just to fail. You don't need to rebuild anything today; you just need to let yourself rest without judgment, because your life matters far more than any business or reputation you ever held.",
